title Storm Tracker — make your own interactieve storm dashboard with live feeds
description A simple, open-source storm dashboard. Explore live examples for Norbert, Marie, and Lowell, then get the source to track a storm of your own.
baseUrl https://knowbooks.com/s/stormTracker/
permalink index.html
openGraphImage norbert.jpg
htmlLang en
buildHtml
metaTags

<header><a class="brand" href="index.html"><span aria-hidden="true">◉</span> Storm Tracker</a><a class="header-link" href="https://github.com/breck7/knowbooks.com/tree/main/s/stormTracker">GitHub ↗</a></header>
<main>
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro">

# Keep an eye on the storm.
 id intro

Live cameras, satellite imagery, and forecasts. Together in one dashboard you can make your own.
 class intro

Get the source on GitHub ↗
 https://github.com/breck7/knowbooks.com/tree/main/s/stormTracker
 class cta

Copy a storm file. Update the settings and feeds. Share with your community.
 class hint

</section>
<section class="examples" aria-labelledby="examples-title">

## Try a working example
 id examples-title

// Newest storms first; prepend new storm cards here.
<div class="example-grid">
<a class="example" href="norbert.html" aria-label="Open the Norbert tracker for Hawaiʻi">
 <img src="norbert.jpg" alt="Norbert dashboard with a Hawaii-wide map, island cameras, and NOAA forecasts" width="1280" height="720">
 <div class="example-caption"><div><h3>Norbert</h3><p>Hawaiʻi · All main islands</p></div><span class="open-example">Open tracker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
</a>
<a class="example" href="marie.html" aria-label="Open the Marie tracker for Los Angeles">
 <img src="marie.jpg" alt="Marie dashboard with a Los Angeles map, Santa Monica cameras, and satellite imagery" width="1600" height="900">
 <div class="example-caption"><div><h3>Marie</h3><p>Los Angeles, California</p></div><span class="open-example">Open tracker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
</a>
<a class="example" href="lowell.html" aria-label="Open the Lowell tracker for Kauaʻi">
 <img src="lowell.jpg" alt="Lowell dashboard with a Kauaʻi map, coastal cameras, and weather imagery" width="1600" height="900">
 <div class="example-caption"><div><h3>Lowell</h3><p>Kauaʻi, Hawaiʻi</p></div><span class="open-example">Open tracker <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div>
</a>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<footer>

Built with Scroll. Made to be copied.
 https://scroll.surf Scroll

</footer>

css
 :root{color-scheme:dark;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;color:#eaf7ff;background:#071016;font-synthesis:none}
 *{box-sizing:border-box}
 body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,rgba(35,105,129,.23),transparent 60%);min-height:100vh}
 a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
 header{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
 .brand{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.025em}
 .brand span{color:#61dffa;font-size:25px}
 .header-link{font-size:13px;color:#a3becb}
 main{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:0 32px}
 .hero{text-align:center;max-width:850px;margin:58px auto 76px}
 h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5.3vw,68px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 22px;font-weight:750;text-wrap:balance}
 .intro{max-width:590px;margin:0 auto;color:#abc3cf;font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);line-height:1.6;text-wrap:balance}
 .cta{margin:30px 0 16px}
 .cta a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px 28px;border-radius:10px;background:#68e1f8;color:#05202a;font-size:18px;font-weight:750;box-shadow:0 8px 34px #30bada20;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}
 .cta a:hover{background:#9cedff;transform:translateY(-2px)}
 .hint{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#7895a4;margin:0}
 .examples h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 20px}
 .example-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}
 .example{display:block;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #25404c;border-radius:14px;background:#0c1921;transition:border-color .18s,transform .18s}
 .example:hover{border-color:#68e1f8;transform:translateY(-3px)}
 .example img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-bottom:1px solid #25404c}
 .example-caption{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:20px 22px}
 .example h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 5px}
 .example p{font-size:13px;color:#93afbd;margin:0}
 .open-example{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#68e1f8;white-space:nowrap}
 footer{max-width:1200px;margin:36px auto 0;padding:24px 32px 32px;color:#7895a4;font-size:12px}
 footer p{margin:0}footer a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
 a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9cedff;outline-offset:5px}
 @media(max-width:650px){header{padding:22px 20px}main{padding:0 20px}.hero{margin:40px auto 52px}.cta a{font-size:16px;padding:17px 22px}.example-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}.example-caption{padding:18px}.open-example{font-size:12px}footer{padding:24px 20px}.hint{max-width:280px;margin:auto}}
 @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important}}
